[h1]Tributary Expansion Directives — 驱策朝贡国[/h1]

Tell a direct AI tributary exactly where you want it to expand.

[list]
[*]Right-click your direct AI tributary and issue an Expansion Directive.
[*]Choose an eligible neighboring foreign county.
[*]Spend 150 Prestige to make the demand. Your Prestige level also affects acceptance.
[*]Optionally offer 12 months of the tributary's income as a war subsidy, clamped to 50–500 Gold and paid only if the order is accepted.
[*]On acceptance, the tributary becomes the primary attacker in a dedicated county conquest. Victory gives the county to the tributary, not the suzerain.
[*]A refusal spends the Prestige and keeps the five-year cooldown, but transfers no Gold.
[/list]

The mod preserves vanilla conquest, tributary-network, herder, truce, alliance, and war restrictions through a second legality check before war starts.

[h1]驱策朝贡国[/h1]

让你的直属 AI 朝贡国向你指定的方向扩张。

[list]
[*]右键直属 AI 朝贡国，选择“发布拓疆令”。
[*]从与其陆地接壤的合资格外国伯爵领中选择目标。
[*]每次有效命令消耗 150 威望；宗主的威望等级也会影响接受度。
[*]可额外提供战争金：朝贡国 12 个月收入，最低 50、最高 500 金币，仅在接受后支付。
[*]接受后，朝贡国会作为主攻方发动专用单伯爵领征服战争；胜利领土归朝贡国，不归宗主。
[*]拒绝会损失威望并保留五年冷却，但不会支付金币。
[/list]

版本：CK3 1.19.0.6。无需 DLC，无其他 mod 依赖。修改角色交互和 CB 的 mod 可能改变兼容性。
